01:04:25.570 --> 01:04:27.430
So and that way, if you
change the ecosystem

01:04:27.430 --> 01:04:30.227
of a formation, which they
get, the Steven Pinkers

01:04:30.227 --> 01:04:32.460
and the John Stuart
Mills and they read them.

01:04:32.460 --> 01:04:34.830
And then when extremist
guys comes into them,

01:04:34.830 --> 01:04:36.930
and is like, hey, do you want
to establish a caliphate,

01:04:36.930 --> 01:04:39.017
and all of that, the answer will be no.

01:04:39.017 --> 01:04:42.057
And not only to be recruited
to the organization,

01:04:42.057 --> 01:04:46.950
but to reject all of that ideology,

01:04:46.950 --> 01:04:48.210
which is the Islamist ideology,

01:04:48.210 --> 01:04:52.830
which is of having authoritarian
state built on religion

01:04:52.830 --> 01:04:55.930
or other authoritarians like the rest.

01:04:55.930 --> 01:04:58.340
So, we've actually had tremendous,

01:04:58.340 --> 01:04:59.460
which actually brings us back

01:04:59.460 --> 01:05:01.630
to the concept of cultural relativism.

01:05:01.630 --> 01:05:05.440
Our content has been
viewed 12 million times.

01:05:05.440 --> 01:05:08.300
In Arabic, I'm not targeting
students of Rochester,

01:05:08.300 --> 01:05:09.600
I'm targeting young Arabs.

01:05:11.382 --> 01:05:15.300
And we have 4.5 million followers.

01:05:15.300 --> 01:05:17.501
So at the beginning, I was like,

01:05:17.501 --> 01:05:20.920
oh, maybe people will not
read this content, it's too,

01:05:20.920 --> 01:05:22.320
the demand is there.

01:05:22.320 --> 01:05:24.920
People want these, at least,

01:05:24.920 --> 01:05:27.150
I think some of it is relative to times,

01:05:27.150 --> 01:05:29.700
is that they have seem
what Islamists look like.

01:05:29.700 --> 01:05:31.182
They live under them.

01:05:31.182 --> 01:05:34.280
For me Al Qaeda is not just
something I see on television.

01:05:34.280 --> 01:05:36.090
I lived under Al Qaeda, I've seen--

01:05:36.090 --> 01:05:37.090
